Third-party data bundled with the apps in this repository

Zmanim: Zmanim/src/main/assets/places/places.tsv
  Place data from GeoNames (geonames.org), licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Filtered and converted for this app; see
  Zmanim/places/README.md for what was changed.

Zmanim: Zmanim/src/main/assets/geoid/geoid.bin
  Geoid heights from EGM2008 by the US National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency (public domain), as
  gridded by GeographicLib (geographiclib.sourceforge.io) and sampled every degree for this app;
  see Zmanim/geoid/README.md.
